Scope
-----

This license covers the prose in this repository: papers and manuscripts,
conjectures, results and analysis documents, observation packets, review and
reconciliation records, definitions, and the README files. In practice that
is the `*.md` files and the rendered `*.pdf` and `*.html` documents built
from them.

It does NOT cover the software. Analysis scripts, collectors, graders, figure
builders, gate checks and other tooling are licensed under the MIT License.
See LICENSE-CODE.

It does NOT cover third-party material archived here for measurement
purposes. Files under any `raw/` directory are verbatim responses from public
third-party APIs, archived so that a published measurement can be re-checked
against exactly what was read. They remain the property of their respective
owners and carry their own terms. Quoted passages from vendor documentation
appear under fair use / fair dealing for purposes of criticism, comment and
research; the pin log records what was read and when, and links to public
archival snapshots rather than redistributing the pages.
